:name: Ground station TAP link
:description: Bridges Node B's Ethernet to a TAP interface (tap0) on the host. Include after system.resc.
:
: Linux only; Renode needs permission to create the TAP device (run it as root).
: Then on the host:  ip addr add 192.168.10.1/24 dev tap0 && ip link set tap0 up

emulation CreateSwitch "groundLink"
mach set "node_b"
connector Connect sysbus.ethernet groundLink
emulation CreateTap "tap0" "tap"
connector Connect host.tap groundLink
mach clear
